      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "It is uncertain whether other changes to the 340B program may be effected through legislation, regulation, or judicial decision, or whether manufacturers will reduce their participation in or take other approaches to the 340B program.",
      "char_start": 39454,
      "char_end": 39688,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          39944,
          40178
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 99,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "530f3c45-dfa7-43f5-a4e3-6a53adef370f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[53]",
        "source_file": "mck-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "7c7616fc-7f86-5b3e-ba6f-15b40dc09a0e"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000927653-26-000069",
      "ticker": "MCK",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The cumulative impact of the foregoing on our customers and our business is difficult to predict.",
      "char_start": 39689,
      "char_end": 39786,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40179,
          40276
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 99,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "530f3c45-dfa7-43f5-a4e3-6a53adef370f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[53]",
        "source_file": "mck-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "e3cdf407-1b1e-52f9-afc5-c155c39691e9"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000927653-26-000069",
      "ticker": "MCK",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Additionally, some states have enacted or are considering laws imposing caps or limits on the price of certain drugs distributed by wholesalers in those states.",
      "char_start": 39788,
      "char_end": 39948,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40278,
          40438
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 100,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "530f3c45-dfa7-43f5-a4e3-6a53adef370f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[53]",
        "source_file": "mck-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "439fdf35-337c-5226-bf57-590776c77b6c"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000927653-26-000069",
      "ticker": "MCK",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "If upheld or enacted, these laws could encourage similar measures in other jurisdictions and could, directly or indirectly, affect wholesaler distribution economics.",
      "char_start": 39949,
      "char_end": 40114,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40439,
          40604
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 100,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "530f3c45-dfa7-43f5-a4e3-6a53adef370f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[53]",
        "source_file": "mck-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "c8f37c0b-6334-53fe-86d3-ab047c7ff2e4"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000927653-26-000069",
      "ticker": "MCK",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We continue to monitor these and other state reform initiatives and their potential impact on our business.",
      "char_start": 40115,
      "char_end": 40222,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40605,
          40712
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 100,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "530f3c45-dfa7-43f5-a4e3-6a53adef370f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[53]",
        "source_file": "mck-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "af33238e-c6fa-593a-8646-a4514fe3142f"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000927653-26-000069",
      "ticker": "MCK",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "adf9cdbf-18cd-472a-a1e1-f610b4f4fb35",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-1",
      "section_type": "business",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Government Regulation",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Government Regulation",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Outside the U.S., provincial governments in Canada that provide partial funding for the purchase of pharmaceuticals and independently regulate the sale and reimbursement of drugs have sought to reduce the costs of publicly funded health programs.",
      "char_start": 40224,
      "char_end": 40470,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40776,
          41022
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 101,
